	"data": "ThoughtBubbles v6 Tech Stack\n\nWhat It Is\nThe finalized technical blueprint for ThoughtBubbles version 6, determined through an extensive iterative decision-making session in early February 2025. This is the canonical stack for the web-first v6 prototype — a major pivot away from Unity/game-engine approaches.\n\nThe Stack\n\nFrontend\n| Component | Choice |\n|---|---|\n| Framework | React + TypeScript |\n| State Management | Redux (Redux Toolkit) |\n| Styling | Tailwind CSS |\n| 3D/XR | React Three Fiber…",
